{"id":"n37063-1-8","stage":3,"title":"그런대로 · 还算","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37063-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 생활은 어떠세요?","zh":"最近生活过得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활은","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"2","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"谋生并维持生计。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/98b29ae644f6a65bf692.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37063-1-8-2","ko":"아르바이트라도 하니 그런대로 먹고살 만해요.","zh":"因为在做兼职，所以还能勉强维持生计。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아르바이트라도","meaning":"打工","explanation":"아르바이트：打工；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"아르바이트","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24506","senseId":"1","lemma":"아르바이트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하니","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런대로","meaning":"还算，将就","explanation":"그런대로：还算，将就","readings":[{"term":"그런대로","audio":"/audio/1e1b15341a5198dc0737.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37063","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고살","meaning":"糊口，生活","explanation":"먹고살다：糊口，生活；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹고살다","audio":"/audio/53a3bf6c5c4bb9c55c19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15982","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹고살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만해요.","meaning":"能够、还过得去（-ㄹ/을 만하다）","explanation":"만하다：能够、还过得去（-ㄹ/을 만하다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"만하다","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53017","senseId":"2","lemma":"만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe901ac998302ac9","term":"아르바이트","zh":"打工","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3","entryId":"24506","definition":"为赚钱而在自己的主业以外临时做的事。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1e1b15341a5198dc","term":"그런대로","zh":"还算，将就","audio":"/audio/1e1b15341a5198dc0737.mp3","entryId":"37063","definition":"虽然不够满意，但那样还过得去地。","pronunciation":["그런대로"]},{"id":"53a3bf6c5c4bb9c5","term":"먹고살다","zh":"糊口，生活","audio":"/audio/53a3bf6c5c4bb9c55c19.mp3","entryId":"15982","definition":"维持生计。","pronunciation":["먹꼬살다"]},{"id":"d24817e6ba3f40d7","term":"만하다","zh":"能够、还过得去（-ㄹ/을 만하다）","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3","entryId":"53017","definition":"能够、还过得去（-ㄹ/을 만하다）","pronunciation":["만하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfb8abbf7750b56c9a8d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.223,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37063","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativec